    "meteorologist": "Hari Dahal",
    "analysis_np": "हाल देशमा बङ्गालको खाडीमा विकसित चक्रवात “अर्नब” को अवशेषका  साथै पश्चिमी वायुको पनि आंशिक प्रभाव रहेको छ। भोलि अपराह्नदेखि भने  यसको प्रभाव क्रमिक रुपमा कम हुने देखिन्छ।",
    "analysis_en": "The country is currently under the partial influence of the remnants of cyclone “Arnab,” which developed over the Bay of Bengal, along with westerly winds. The influence of these systems is expected to gradually weaken from tomorrow afternoon onwards.",
    "today_np": "",
    "today_en": "Mostly cloudy in Koshi, Madhesh, Bagmati, Gandaki, Lumbini and Karnali provinces, and generally cloudy in Sudurpashchim Province. There is a possibility of light to moderate rain/snowfall accompanied by thunder and lightning at many places in Koshi, Madhesh, Bagmati and Gandaki provinces, and at a few places in Lumbini, Karnali and Sudurpashchim provinces. Heavy rain/snowfall is possible at a few places in Koshi, Madhesh, Bagmati and Gandaki provinces, and at one or two places in the Himalayan and hilly regions of Lumbini, Karnali and Sudurpashchim provinces.",
    "tomorrow_np": "",
    "tomorrow_en": "Generally cloudy throughout the country. There is a possibility of light to moderate rain/snowfall accompanied by thunder and lightning at a few places in the Himalayan and hilly regions. Light to moderate rainfall accompanied by thunder and lightning is also possible at one or two places in the Terai region.",
    "special": ""
  }
